Arenas(arena_name, city)
    FD's:
arena_name -> city
arena_name is the key, BCNF

Teams(team_id, name, abbreviation, arena_name)
    FD's:
team_id -> name, abbreviation, arena_name
name -> team_id, abbreviation, arena_name
abbreviation -> team_id, name, arena_name

All three on the left (determinants) could be used as keys 

Seasons(season_year_start, season_start_date, winning_team_id)
    FD's:
season_year_start -> season_start_date, winning_team_id
Only the key determines any of the other columns, BCNF

Players(player_id, first_name, last_name, nickname, height_cm, weight_kg, nationality, birth_date, draft_year, draft_round, draft_pick)
    FD's:
player_id -> first_name, last_name, nickname, birth_date, height_cm, weight_kg, nationality, draft_year, draft_round, draft_pick
draft_year, draft_round, draft_pick -> player_id
Both on left (determinants) could be used as keys , BCNF

Skaters(player_id, position, shoots)
    FD's:
player_id -> position, shoots
Only the key determines any of the other columns, BCNF

Goalies(player_id, catches)
    FD's:
player_id -> catches
Only the key determines any of the other columns, BCNF

Games(game_id, game_date, home_team_id, away_team_id, home_score, away_score, season_year_start)
    FD's:
game_id -> all other columns
(home_team_id, game_date) -> game_id, and so all other columns
(away_team_id, game_date) -> game_id, and so all other columns
All three determinants are candidate keys, BCNF

Player_History(player_id, start_date, end_date, team_id, jersey_number)
    FD's:
player_id, team_id, start_date -> end_date, jersey_number
Only the combination of keys determines any of the other columns, BCNF.

Skater_Game_Stats(player_id, game_id, goals, assists, plus_minus, pim)
    FD's:
player_id, game_id -> goals, assists, plus_minus, pim
Only the key determines the other columns, BCNF

Goalie_Game_Stats(player_id, game_id, shots_against, saves, decision)
    FD's:
player_id, game_id -> shots_against, saves, decision
Only the key determines the other columns, BCNF
(goals_against and save_pct are derived, so they are generated columns and not part of the relation)